  "items": [
    {
      "name": "When your allergy test comes back clean",
      "char_file": "긴장_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Runny nose and congestion",
        "keep coming back, but",
        "allergy testing is negative",
        "",
        "It's not an allergen at all —",
        "your nasal lining is reacting",
        "to nonspecific triggers instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger #1: temperature swings",
      "char_file": "온도차_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Moving between heated",
        "or air-conditioned rooms",
        "and the outside air",
        "",
        "makes vessels in your",
        "nasal lining suddenly dilate —",
        "symptoms can hit in minutes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Buffer the swing before you head out",
      "char_file": "마스크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Layer up and cover",
        "your nose with a scarf",
        "in cold weather",
        "",
        "It gives your nasal lining",
        "time to adjust instead of",
        "reacting all at once"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger #2: dry indoor air",
      "char_file": "하얀국_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Heating and A/C",
        "dry out the nasal lining",
        "",
        "A drier lining reacts",
        "more strongly to every",
        "other trigger on this list"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Keep indoor air humid",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Run a humidifier to keep",
        "indoor humidity between",
        "40 and 60 percent",
        "",
        "A saline nasal spray",
        "helps too — use it",
        "as often as you need"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger #3: strong smells & stress",
      "char_file": "담배_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Perfume, cleaning products,",
        "cigarette smoke, stress,",
        "and sudden emotional shifts",
        "",
        "can set off the same",
        "nerve response —",
        "with no allergen involved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "This calls for targeted treatment",
      "char_file": "비강스프레이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Regular allergy pills",
        "often don't touch it",
        "",
        "Azelastine and budesonide",
        "nasal sprays are approved",
        "specifically for this —",
        "ask your doctor about them"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Buffer temperature swings,",
        "keep indoor air humid,"
      ],
      [
        "and avoid your specific triggers —",
        "flare-ups drop noticeably"
      ]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "See an ENT if congestion or a runny nose lasts more than a few weeks",
      "If allergy medication never helped, mention that at your appointment — the cause may be nonallergic"
    ],
